<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Traveller Blog</title>

<style>

body{
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    margin:0;
    background:#f2f2f2;
}

header{
    background:#555;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Navigation */

nav{
    background:#777;
    padding:10px;
    text-align:center;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:0 15px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a:hover{
    text-decoration:underline;
}

/* Container */

.container{
    width:85%;
    margin:auto;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Blog Posts */

.blog-post{
    background:white;
    padding:20px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    border-radius:8px;
    box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.blog-post img{
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.blog-post h2{
    color:#444;
}

/* Footer */

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:15px;
    background:#555;
    color:white;
    margin-top:30px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>My Travel Blog</h1>
<p>Stories From My Adventures</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#">Trips</a>
<a href="#">Gallery</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">

<div class="blog-post">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x200">
<h2>Trip to Goa</h2>
<p>
I spent an amazing weekend in Goa enjoying the beaches, sunsets,
and delicious seafood. The peaceful waves and vibrant nightlife
made it one of my most memorable trips.
</p>
</div>

<div class="blog-post">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x200">
<h2>Exploring Manali</h2>
<p>
Manali was full of snow-covered mountains and breathtaking views.
I tried local food, visited Solang Valley, and experienced the
cold mountain air which felt refreshing.
</p>
</div>

<div class="blog-post">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x200">
<h2>Journey to Jaipur</h2>
<p>
Jaipur's palaces and forts were stunning. Walking through the
historic streets and seeing the Hawa Mahal and Amber Fort made
the trip feel like stepping into royal history.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Traveller Blog | Sharing My Journeys</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
